      "writing OUT file:  /Users/stephenprice/projects/CINS/ColdHarbor/test-data-out/v3.LR.historical_thkConc_ensembleStats/v3.LR.historical_EnsStats.mpassi.hist.am.timeSeriesStatsDaily.2000-12-01.nc\n"
